*Output*foreground:     #fbf2ed
*Output*font:           courier-12
*text*background:       #1c1218
*text*foreground:       #fbf2ed
*text*font:             courier-12
*Text*background:       #1c1218
*Text*foreground:       #fbf2ed
*Text*font:             courier-12
*Text_Display*background: #1c1218
*Text_Display*foreground: #fbf2ed
